  "title": "Gold Overtakes Dollar Reserves as Global Trust Shifts",
  "summary": "Gold is reasserting itself as the world’s preferred neutral reserve asset amid eroding confidence in the U.S. dollar system, supported by strong central bank buying and rising geopolitical fragmentation. Silver is evolving beyond a cyclical industrial metal into a strategic energy security asset, with demand increasingly tied to solar, storage and resilient infrastructure investment.",
